  Matches the geometry drawn by BrandMark() in ui/Theme.kt, on the same 108-unit
  viewport, so the launcher icon and the in-app mark are the same shape. Bars
  are inside the 66dp adaptive-icon safe zone, so no launcher mask clips them.
-->
